+
+ORC is the UX surface to Justin's own agentic system: specialised agents, reached through Iris, with ADA creating new
+ones. Justin, 2026-09-25: his **ChatGPT replacement, daily tool, agentic development test ground, and eventual work
+showpiece**. Justin, 2026-09-26: once the six slots work, **work towards a point of consolidation**.
